      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Spinal abscess is a rare condition. Its presentation can often be subtle and insidious. This report describes the diagnosis and management of an 87-year-old man who presented to our orthopaedic clinic. We would like to emphasise the importance of rapid diagnosis and prompt treatment in such cases."},
